<title>USA: Retsinas new acting director of US thrift agency.</title>
<headline>Retsinas new acting director of US thrift agency.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicolas Retsinas, assistant secretary for housing at the Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD), was sworn in Thursday as acting director of the Office of Thrift Supervision, a Treasury spokesman confirmed.</p>
<p>Retsinas will retain his HUD responsibilities, the spokesman said.  </p>
<p>Jonathan Fiechter, the previous acting director of the thrift agency, left Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fiechter had announced this summer that he would resign to join the World Bank as director of the financial sector development department.</p>
<p>America's Community Bankers, the trade association for thrifts, said it was &quot;delighted&quot; that Retsinas was named to the post.</p>
